      "term": "Recurrent Looped Transformer (RLT)",
      "briefZh": "循环环路",
      "explanationZh": "一种在解码器中循环传递隐藏状态的 Transformer 变体。"
    },
    {
      "term": "sliding-window attention (SWA)",
      "briefZh": "滑动窗口",
      "explanationZh": "每层仅在最近的窗口内计算注意力，以减少计算开销。"
    },
